Earliest fit:

```ts
function earliestFit(free: Array<[number,number]>, duration: number): {startMin: number; endMin: number} | null {
  for (const [s, e] of free) {
    if (e - s >= duration) return {startMin: s, endMin: s + duration};
  }
  return null;
}
```

Note: free intervals from subtractSegments remain sorted and disjoint. Good.

